  "title": "Syrian Rice with Meat",
  "description": "This Syrian rice dish features ground beef seasoned with allspice, cinnamon, and black pepper and mixed with pine nuts. You can also try it with other meat, like lamb.",
  "authors": [
    "SGEORGE952"
  ],
